classes\ should\ not\ have\ a\ Kafka\ listener\ that\ calls\ subscribe()\ or\ swallows\ its\ processing\ error\ (onErrorResume(e\ ->\ Mono.empty()),\ onErrorComplete()),\ directly\ or\ through\ a\ method\ or\ lambda\ of\ the\ same\ class,\ because\ a\ listener\ failure\ must\ reach\ the\ container\:\ retries,\ then\ tnt.dlq\ (decision\ G.8)=03b0f146-a29f-490e-aa3b-66086ebab97b
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..adapter.in..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..adapter.out..',\ because\ inbound\ adapters\ (web\ controllers,\ Kafka/messaging\ consumers)\ must\ go\ through\ application\ ports,\ never\ call\ outbound\ adapters\ directly=6c0488e3-9ef5-4bac-b898-371999f148df
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..application..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ '..adapter.in.web..',\ because\ the\ application\ layer\ must\ not\ know\ about\ web-facing\ request/response\ DTOs\ (Audit\ n1\ A6)\ \u2014\ controllers\ map\ to/from\ web\ DTOs,\ application\ services\ expose\ domain/entity\ types\ only=209b387f-7fd1-4d8c-8c49-830d9989e5c7
